{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき乃木どこ観ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のカエルの怖がり様には自分でもびっくりするけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくらバラエティ担当と言われている私でもあれは演技のリアクションじゃない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガチです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カエルは......嫌いだよ。（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってだって、あれは大きすぎるよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カエルさんに罪はないよ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないけどさ、でもさ、なんなの。あの威圧感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーラありすぎでしょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全くたっくだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ、お手上げだ。\nね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/09/5592862/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の乃木どこの衣装がみんないかつかったから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかついといえば...このメンバーで集まらなきゃでしょ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BEASTレディース！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは豹柄ヤンキーになりきった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもちろいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話は切り替えて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青森ライブ無事に終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/09/5592862/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツインテールでしたのえへへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロリ担当だお？？❤え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージには、たくさんの仕掛けがあってね、おいでシャンプーの時に大量のシャボン玉と、\n花火がぶぁーー！！ってついたりすごく華やかなステージを作っていただきました( *｀ω´) ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/09/5592862/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップル！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青森は涼しくて大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野外ステージはやっぱり開放的で好きだな＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああーーー！！！って言いたくなる(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"by扇風機"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また青森行けますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/09/09/5592862/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アロハ。"}],"source":"archive"}